      "name": "一、选择题",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q1",
          "stem": "设 $f(x)=\\int_0^x e^{-t^2}\\,dt$，则 $f'(x)=$ ?",
          "options": ["$e^{-x^2}$", "$2x e^{-x^2}$", "$-e^{-x^2}$", "$0$"],
          "answer": "A",
          "analysis": "由微积分基本定理，$\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_0^x g(t)\\,dt = g(x)$。因此 $f'(x) = e^{-x^2}$，故选 A。",
          "chart": null
        },
        {
          "id": "q2",
          "stem": "若复数 $z = \\frac{1+i}{1-i}$，则 $|z|=$ ?",
          "options": ["$1$", "$\\sqrt{2}$", "$2$", "$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$"],
          "answer": "A",
          "analysis": "$z = \\frac{(1+i)^2}{(1-i)(1+i)} = \\frac{1+2i+i^2}{2} = i$，故 $|z| = |i| = 1$。",
          "chart": null
        },
        {
          "id": "q3",
          "stem": "已知等差数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 满足 $a_1 + a_3 = 8$，$a_2 + a_4 = 14$，则公差 $d=$ ?",
          "options": ["$3$", "$4$", "$5$", "$6$"],
          "answer": "A",
          "analysis": "由 $a_2 + a_4 - (a_1 + a_3) = 2d = 6$，得 $d = 3$。",
          "chart": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "二、填空题",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q4",
          "stem": "已知向量 $\\vec{a} = (1, 2)$，$\\vec{b} = (x, 1)$，若 $\\vec{a} \\perp \\vec{b}$，则 $x = $ ____",
          "options": null,
          "answer": "$-2$",
          "analysis": "由 $\\vec{a} \\cdot \\vec{b} = 0$，即 $1 \\cdot x + 2 \\cdot 1 = 0$，解得 $x = -2$。",
          "chart": null
        },
        {
          "id": "q5",
          "stem": "函数 $f(x) = \\ln x - ax$ 在 $x=1$ 处取得极值，则 $a = $ ____",
          "options": null,
          "answer": "$1$",
          "analysis": "$f'(x) = \\frac{1}{x} - a$，由 $f'(1) = 0$ 得 $1 - a = 0$，故 $a = 1$。",
          "chart": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "三、解答题",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q6",
          "stem": "已知函数 $f(x) = x^3 - 3x^2 + 2$。\n\n(1) 求 $f(x)$ 的单调区间；\n(2) 求 $f(x)$ 在 $[-1, 3]$ 上的最大值和最小值。",
          "options": null,
          "answer": "(1) 单调递增区间：$(-\\infty, 0)$ 和 $(2, +\\infty)$；单调递减区间：$(0, 2)$\n(2) 最大值：$f(0) = 2$；最小值：$f(2) = -2$",
          "analysis": "(1) $f'(x) = 3x^2 - 6x = 3x(x-2)$\n\n令 $f'(x) > 0$，得 $x < 0$ 或 $x > 2$\n令 $f'(x) < 0$，得 $0 < x < 2$\n\n(2) $f(-1) = -1 - 3 + 2 = -2$\n$f(0) = 0 - 0 + 2 = 2$\n$f(2) = 8 - 12 + 2 = -2$\n$f(3) = 27 - 27 + 2 = 2$\n\n比较得最大值为 $2$，最小值为 $-2$。",
          "chart": {
            "type": "echarts",
            "spec": {
              "title": { "text": "函数 $f(x) = x^3 - 3x^2 + 2$ 的图像" },
              "xAxis": { "type": "value", "name": "x" },
              "yAxis": { "type": "value", "name": "y" },
              "series": [{
                "type": "line",
                "data": [
                  [-1.5, -8.375], [-1, -2], [-0.5, 1.375], [0, 2], [0.5, 1.375],
                  [1, 0], [1.5, -1.375], [2, -2], [2.5, -1.375], [3, 2], [3.5, 6.375]
                ]
              }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "q7",
          "stem": "如图，在三棱柱 $ABC-A_1B_1C_1$ 中，$AB = AC$，$D$ 为 $BC$ 的中点，$A_1D \\perp$ 平面 $ABC$。\n\n求证：(1) $A_1B = A_1C$；\n(2) 平面 $A_1AD \\perp$ 平面 $BCC_1B_1$。",
          "options": null,
          "answer": "证明见解析",
          "analysis": "(1) 因为 $A_1D \\perp$ 平面 $ABC$，所以 $A_1D \\perp BC$。\n又 $AB = AC$，$D$ 为 $BC$ 中点，故 $AD \\perp BC$。\n$BC \\perp$ 平面 $A_1AD$，所以 $BC \\perp A_1D$。\n在 $\\triangle A_1BD$ 和 $\\triangle A_1CD$ 中，$BD = CD$，$A_1D$ 公共，$\\angle A_1DB = \\angle A_1DC = 90^\\circ$，\n故 $\\triangle A_1BD \\cong \\triangle A_1CD$，所以 $A_1B = A_1C$。\n\n(2) 由(1)知 $BC \\perp$ 平面 $A_1AD$，又 $BC \\subset$ 平面 $BCC_1B_1$，\n所以平面 $A_1AD \\perp$ 平面 $BCC_1B_1$。",
          "chart": {
            "type": "mermaid",
            "spec": "graph TD\n    A1[A₁] --> A[A]\n    A1 --> B1[B₁]\n    A1 --> C1[C₁]\n    A --> B[B]\n    A --> C[C]\n    B --> D[D]\n    C --> D\n    style D fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
